{"page":16,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"CHAPTER 01 • 컴퓨터 네트워크와 인터넷","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER","x":596,"y":135,"width":127,"height":25},{"text":"01","x":734,"y":136,"width":31,"height":24},{"text":"•","x":801,"y":142,"width":13,"height":12},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":848,"y":136,"width":77,"height":29},{"text":"네트워크와","x":938,"y":136,"width":133,"height":29},{"text":"인터넷","x":1082,"y":136,"width":78,"height":30}]},{"text":"여러분이 손을 든디(」고수님에게 암시적인 메시지 전송). 교-수님은 웃으며 “너卜특“하변","words":[{"text":"여러분이","x":573,"y":262,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"손을","x":723,"y":263,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"든디(」고수님에게","x":807,"y":263,"width":251,"height":39},{"text":"암시적인","x":1077,"y":264,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"메시지","x":1229,"y":263,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"전송).","x":1348,"y":262,"width":86,"height":37},{"text":"교-수님은","x":1453,"y":261,"width":139,"height":37},{"text":"웃으며","x":1607,"y":262,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"“너卜특“하변","x":1726,"y":262,"width":164,"height":46}]},{"text":"서 여러분을 가리기고(질문해도 좋디는 메시지). 여러분은 교수님에게 질문한tl(교수","words":[{"text":"서","x":573,"y":322,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"여러분을","x":622,"y":322,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"가리기고(질문해도","x":775,"y":322,"width":285,"height":39},{"text":"좋디는","x":1077,"y":324,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"메시지).","x":1196,"y":323,"width":123,"height":38},{"text":"여러분은","x":1338,"y":321,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"교수님에게","x":1491,"y":321,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"질문한tl(교수","x":1684,"y":322,"width":208,"height":43}]},{"text":"님에게 메시지를 전송). 교수님은 여러분의 질문을 듣고(질문 메시지를 수신) 그 질문","words":[{"text":"님에게","x":571,"y":383,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"메시지를","x":688,"y":382,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"전송).","x":841,"y":382,"width":86,"height":38},{"text":"교수님은","x":944,"y":383,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"여러분의","x":1097,"y":382,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"질문을","x":1252,"y":382,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"듣고(질문","x":1366,"y":380,"width":152,"heig