,"x":743,"y":860,"width":70,"height":35},{"text":"활동은","x":824,"y":857,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"프로토콜이","x":940,"y":857,"width":168,"height":37},{"text":"제어한다.","x":1127,"y":856,"width":145,"height":39},{"text":"물리적으로","x":1287,"y":858,"width":175,"height":37},{"text":"연결된","x":1478,"y":858,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"두","x":1593,"y":860,"width":35,"height":35},{"text":"컴퓨터의","x":1643,"y":857,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"네트워","x":1793,"y":857,"width":93,"height":42}]},{"text":"그 접속 카드에서 하드웨어로 구현된 프로토콜은 컴퓨터 사이에 연결된 “선로상”의 비","words":[{"text":"그","x":557,"y":924,"width":34,"height":26},{"text":"접속","x":607,"y":918,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"카드에서","x":688,"y":919,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"하드웨어로","x":838,"y":917,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"구현된","x":1022,"y":917,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"프로토콜은","x":1140,"y":918,"width":174,"height":36},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":1330,"y":918,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"사이에","x":1446,"y":919,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"연결된","x":1566,"y":918,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"“선로상”의","x":1681,"y":917,"width":160,"height":40},{"text":"비","x":1859,"y":924,"width":26,"height":37}]},{"text":"1그 근 제어한다. 예를 들어, 종단 시스템에 있는 혼잡제어(congestion-control) 프","words":[{"text":"1그","x":645,"y":1004,"width":21,"height":12},{"text":"근","x":679,"y":1002,"width":23,"height":14},{"text":"제어한다.","x":723,"y":979,"width":143,"height":38},{"text":"예를","x":885,"y":979,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"들어,","x":966,"y":978,"width":77,"height":38},{"text":"종단","x":1060,"y":979,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"시스템에","x":1145,"y":979,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"있는","x":1300,"y":979,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"혼잡제어(congestion-control)","x":1382,"y":980,"width":460,"height":41},{"text":"프","x":1857,"y":988,"width":31,"height":28}]},{"text":"드 言-르-0-","words":[{"text":"드","x":560,"y":984,"width":25,"height":18},{"text":"言-르-0-","x":609,"y":980,"width":99,"height":25}]},{"text":"로토콜은 송수신자 간에 전송되는 패것률을 조절한다. 라우터에서 프로토콜은 송신지","words":[{"text":"로토콜은","x":554,"y":1041,"width":139,"height":36},{"text":"송수신자","x":706,"y":1040,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"간에","x":860,"y":1040,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"전송되는","x":944,"y":1039,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"패것률을","x":1097,"y":1040,"width":138,"height":37},{"text":"조절한다.","x":1250,"y":1040,"width":146,"height":39},{"text":"라우터에서","x":1415,"y":1041,"width":169,"height":38},{"text":"프로토콜은","x":1604,"y":1041,"width":172,"height":36},{"text":"송신지","x":1790,"y":1041,"width":95,"height":42}]},{"text":"에서 목적지까지 패킷의 경로로 설정한다. 이들 프로토콜은 인터넷의 모든 영역에서","words":[{"text":"에서","x":554,"y":1102,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"목적지까지","x":638,"y":1102,"width":169,"height":37},{"text":"패킷의","x":829,"y":1102,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"경로로","x":950,"y":1101,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"설정한다.","x":1070,"y":1101,"width":145,"height":38},{"text":"이들","x":1237,"y":1102,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"프로토콜은","x":1322,"y":1104,"width":176,"height":36},{"text":"인터넷의","x":1517,"y":1102,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"모든","x":1671,"y":1104,"width":69,"height":34},{"text":"영역에서","x":1759,"y":1102,"width":126,"height":42}]},{"text":"작동하므로 이 책의 많은 부분에서 컴퓨터 네트워크 프로토콜을 다룬다.","words":[{"text":"작동하므로","x":553,"y":1163,"width":172,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":739,"y":1163,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"책의","x":786,"y":1163,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"많은","x":865,"y":1163,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"부분에서","x":946,"y":1162,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":1101,"y":1162,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크","x":1216,"y":1162,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"프로토콜을","x":1368,"y":1164,"width":175,"height":37},{"text":"다룬다.","x":1556,"y":1164,"width":111,"height":37}]},{"text":"여러분에게 친숙한 컴퓨터 네트워크 프로토콜의 한 예를 보자. 웹 서버에 요청할","words":[{"text":"여러분에게","x":620,"y":1224,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"친숙한","x":809,"y":1224,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":928,"y":1224,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"네트워크","x":1046,"y":1224,"width":138,"height":37},{"text":"프로토콜의","x":1199,"y":1225,"width":171,"height":37},{"text":"한","x":1390,"y":1225,"width":36,"height":36},{"text":"예를","x":1442,"y":1226,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"보자.","x":1526,"y":1225,"width":77,"height":38},{"text":"웹","x":1623,"y":1225,"width":30,"height":37},{"text":"서버에","x":1673,"y":1225,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"요청할","x":1790,"y":1227,"width":100,"height":39}]},{"text":"때, 즉 웹브라우저에서 웹 페이지의 URL을 입력하면, 어떤 일이 발생하는지 생각해","words":[{"text":"때,","x":552,"y":1286,"width":40,"height":38},{"text":"즉","x":610,"y":1288,"width":36,"height":36},{"text":"웹브라우저에서","x":663,"y":1286,"width":237,"height":37},{"text":"웹","x":922,"y":1286,"width":30,"height":37},{"text":"페이지의","x":973,"y":1285,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"URL을","x":1128,"y":1285,"width":114,"height":37},{"text":"입력하면,","x":1261,"y":1285,"width":146,"height":38},{"text":"어떤","x":1428,"y":1286,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"일이","x":1516,"y":1286,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"발생하는지","x":1601,"y":1286,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"생각해","x":1791,"y":1287,"width":96,"height":41}]},{"text":"보자. 그 시나리오를 그림 1.2의 오른쪽에서 볼 수 있다. 먼저 여러분의 컴퓨터가 연결","words":[{"text":"보자.","x":549,"y":1347,"width":76,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":641,"y":1353,"width":34,"height":25},{"text":"시나리오를","x":691,"y":1347,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"그림","x":876,"y":1347,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"1.2의","x":962,"y":1347,"width":77,"height":37},{"text":"오른쪽에서","x":1057,"y":1346,"width":169,"height":38},{"text":"볼","x":1244,"y":1346,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":1293,"y":1347,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":1344,"y":1347,"width":74,"height":37},{"text":"먼저","x":1437,"y":1347,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"여러분의","x":1521,"y":1347,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"컴퓨터가","x":1675,"y":1347,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"연결","x":1826,"y":1350,"width":61,"height":39}]},{"text":"요청 메시지를 웹 서버에 보내고 응답을 기다린다. 웹 서버는 연결 요청 메시지를 받","words":[{"text":"요청","x":548,"y":1409,"wi